matters connected with or incidental to such operation and maintenance, provision of 
services and facilities, and collection of Fee in accordance with the provisions of this 
Agreement; 
“O&M Contract” means the operation and maintenance contract that may be entered into 
between the Concessionaire and the O&M Contractor for performance of all or any of the 
O&M obligations; 
“O&M Contractor” means the person, if any, with whom the Concessionaire has entered 
into an O&M Contract for discharging O&M obligations for and on behalf of the


