“Provisional Certificate” shall have the meaning set forth in Clause 14.3; 
“Punch List” shall have the meaning ascribed to it in Clause 14.3.1; 
“RBI” means the Reserve Bank of India, as constituted and existing under the Reserve 
Bank of India Act, 1934, including any statutory modification or replacement thereof, and 
its successors; 
“Re.”, “Rs.” or “Rupees” or “Indian Rupees” means the lawful currency of the Republic 
of India; 
“Real Estate Development” shall have the meaning set forth in Clause 3.1.3; 
